  "details": "For those who would like to be blue only for certain friends (Favorite group).\n\nBeing orange is still dissuasive for many people who are afraid to request orange people.\n\nSometimes we want to be blue for certain friends only.\n\nIt would be cool to pick a friends group only to see me on blue and everyone else orange.\n\nBut we need more than favorite friends feature, we need tags, some friends are fun but don't know how to behave in certain environments. \n\nWe can have different type of friends but we can't mix them. \n\nThat's it, just a suggestion.\n\nThanks!",
